{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"四年春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"夏，逆婦姜于齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"秋，楚人滅江。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"晉侯伐秦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"衛侯使甯俞來聘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"冬十有一月壬寅，夫人風氏薨。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"四年春，晉人歸孔達於衛，以為衛之良也，故免之。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"夏，衛侯如晉拜。曹伯如晉會正。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"逆婦姜于齊，卿不行，非禮也。君子是以知出姜之不允於魯也。曰：「貴聘而賤逆之，君而卑之，立而廢之，棄信而壞其主，在國必亂，在家必亡。不允宜哉。《詩》曰：『畏天之威，于時保之。』敬主之謂也。」","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"秋，晉侯伐秦，圍刓、新城，以報王官之役。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"楚人滅江，秦伯為之降服、出次、不舉、過數。大夫諫，公曰：「同盟滅，雖不能救，敢不矜乎！吾自懼也！」君子曰：「《詩》云：『惟彼二國，其政不獲，惟此四國，爰究爰度。』其秦穆之謂矣？」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"衛甯武子來聘，公與之宴，為賦《湛露》及《彤弓》。不辭，又不答賦。使行人私焉。對曰：「臣以為肄業及之也。昔諸侯朝正於王，王宴樂之，於是乎賦《湛露》，則天子當陽，諸侯用命也。諸侯敵王所愾，而獻其功，王于是乎賜之彤弓一，彤矢百，玈弓矢千，以覺報宴。今陪臣來繼舊好，君辱貺之，其敢干大禮以自取戾？」","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_100_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_100","textTraditional":"冬，成風薨。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}